	<annotations>
		<text id="0" type="text/plain" rect="(20.0, 15.0, 780.0, 48.0)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="13">Official M3 temporal design: train uses Shinjuku Q1 features with Q2 labels; final test uses Shinjuku Q2 features with Q3 labels.</text>
		<text id="1" type="text/plain" rect="(230.0, 470.0, 520.0, 42.0)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="13">Preprocess is connected to learners, not Test &amp; Score Data. Therefore imputation, encoding and normalization are fit inside each CV training fold.</text>
		<text id="2" type="text/plain" rect="(735.0, 90.0, 450.0, 72.0)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="13">GUI CV: 5 folds and Stratified, using Orange 3.40 internal seed 42. Official reported results come from M3_run_orange.py with seed 20261031.</text>
		<text id="3" type="text/plain" rect="(735.0, 750.0, 430.0, 46.0)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="13">Final test: Constant versus the train-CV selected Random Forest only. Do not use final-test results to tune model settings.</text>
	</annotations>
